# Project Overview

This package is a thin PHP wrapper around the [Bling ERP API v3](https://developer.bling.com.br/). It exposes entity modules that mirror Bling resource groups and delegates HTTP to a shared repository.

## Layering

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Facade | `src/Bling.php` | `new Bling($accessToken)`, `@property` getters, lazy modules |
| Auth | `src/Bling.php`, `src/Providers/IoC.php` | Bearer access token and fixed API base URL |
| Entities | `src/Entities/<Module>/` | One class per Bling resource; maps methods to repository calls |
| Repository | `src/Repositories/` | HTTP verbs, auth header, response envelope |
| Provider | `src/Providers/IoC.php` | `IoC::getRepository($accessToken)` |
| Contracts | `src/Contracts/` | `IResponseObject`, `IResponseRootObject` |
| Exceptions | `src/Exceptions/` | API, internal, and payload-parse failures |
| Helpers | `src/Helpers/functions.php` | Date strings, `objectToArray`, `fake` |
| Shared | `src/Entities/@shared/` | Base entity, response parser, request DTOs, shared enums |

## Assumptions

- Targets **PHP 8.2** and **Bling API v3**.
- Resource base URL is `https://www.bling.com.br/Api/v3/` (`src/Providers/IoC.php`).
- Callers pass an existing access token: `new Bling($accessToken)`.
- Endpoint paths and query names follow the Bling reference (Portuguese, kebab-case segments).
- Runtime dependency is **guzzlehttp/guzzle** (`composer.json`).
- PSR-4 root is `AleBatistella\BlingErpApi\` → `src/`. A directory named `@shared` is the `Shared` namespace segment, registered under `autoload.psr-4` in `composer.json`.
- Tests are `*.spec.php` files under `src/` (`phpunit.xml`). `.gitattributes` marks `*.spec.php` and `**/__tests__` as `export-ignore`.
- Pull requests target `develop`. Subjects follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/). Member names are `camelCase`. Class names are `PascalCase`.

## Entity Module Inventory

Each name below is one camelCase getter on `Bling`. The matching folder is PascalCase under `src/Entities/`. `@shared` is the shared layer from the table above and has no getter.

`borderos`, `camposCustomizados`, `canaisDeVenda`, `categoriasLojas`, `categoriasProdutos`, `categoriasReceitasDespesas`, `contasContabeis`, `contasPagar`, `contasReceber`, `contatos`, `contatosTipos`, `contratos`, `depositos`, `empresas`, `estoques`, `formasDePagamentos`, `gruposDeProdutos`, `homologacao`, `logisticas`, `logisticasEtiquetas`, `logisticasObjetos`, `logisticasRemessas`, `logisticasServicos`, `naturezasDeOperacoes`, `nfces`, `nfes`, `nfses`, `notificacoes`, `ordensDeProducao`, `pedidosCompras`, `pedidosVendas`, `produtos`, `produtosEstruturas`, `produtosFornecedores`, `produtosLojas`, `produtosVariacoes`, `propostasComerciais`, `situacoes`, `situacoesModulos`, `situacoesTransicoes`, `usuarios`, `vendedores`.

Folder names are PascalCase (`src/Entities/FormasDePagamentos/`). Getter names are camelCase (`$bling->formasDePagamentos`).

## Consumer Flow

1. `$bling = new Bling($accessToken)` from `src/Bling.php`.
2. Read a module through its getter (`$bling->contatos`).
3. Call an entity method. It returns a schema object or `null`, or throws `BlingApiException` / `BlingInternalException`.

## Modularity Principles

- **One entity folder = one Bling resource group.** The public class is `<Module>.php`.
- **HTTP stays in the repository.** Entity methods call `$this->repository->*` and finish with `*Response::fromResponse($response)`.
- **Shared types come from `AleBatistella\BlingErpApi\Entities\Shared`.** A module reuses another module's schema only through its own `Schema\Shared` namespace (`ContasPagar`, `ContasReceber`).
- **The bearer header is set in `BlingRepository`.** Entities do not set `Authorization`.
- **One instance per module per client.** `Bling::getModule` caches by class name.
